1
00:00:00,983 --> 00:00:02,453
(Howard:)Oh.

2
00:00:02,518 --> 00:00:06,158
(Sheldon:)Would you care to play
an ocean-themed game I invented?

3
00:00:06,222 --> 00:00:07,292
(Amy:)Sure. What is it?

4
00:00:07,356 --> 00:00:09,556
(Sheldon:)It's called Food, Friend, Fight.

5
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:11,925
(Sheldon:)One of us chooses
three aquatic creatures,

6
00:00:11,994 --> 00:00:14,464
(Sheldon:)and the other one must decide
which he would eat,

7
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:17,200
(Sheldon:)befriend, or battle.

8
00:00:17,266 --> 00:00:19,836
(Amy:)So it's like Kiss, Marry, Kill.

9
00:00:19,902 --> 00:00:20,972
(Sheldon:)What is that?

10
00:00:21,037 --> 00:00:22,867
(Amy:)It's a game
where you're given three people

11
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:25,639
(Amy:)and you choose which one
you'd kiss, marry, or kill.

12
00:00:25,708 --> 00:00:28,348
(Sheldon:)Well, my game is better, 'cause
instead of marrying someone,

13
00:00:28,411 --> 00:00:31,081
(Sheldon:)you get to eat them.

14
00:00:31,147 --> 00:00:32,347
(Amy:)Let's just play.

15
00:00:32,415 --> 00:00:33,945
(Sheldon:)I'll start
you off easy.

16
00:00:34,016 --> 00:00:38,686
(Sheldon:)Electric eel,
pufferfish, shrimp.

17
00:00:38,754 --> 00:00:41,354
(Amy:)Hmm. Well,

18
00:00:41,424 --> 00:00:42,894
(Amy:)I wouldn't fight the eel,
because I know

19
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:45,389
(Amy:)it can generate enough current
to kill a horse.

20
00:00:45,461 --> 00:00:47,031
(Amy:)So I'd eat
the eel,

21
00:00:47,096 --> 00:00:50,236
(Amy:)fight the shrimp,
and befriend the pufferfish,

22
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:51,629
(Amy:)because it would be nice
to have company

23
00:00:51,701 --> 00:00:53,771
(Amy:)on those days I feel bloated.

24
00:00:54,804 --> 00:00:56,274
(Sheldon:)Very well done.

25
00:00:56,339 --> 00:00:57,269
(Amy:)Thank you.

